1
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:06,865
An administrator sets the contact type up once.

2
00:00:06,865 --> 00:00:12,350
Open Design, Content Definition, Content Types, and edit the Contact type.

3
00:00:12,803 --> 00:00:15,201
Edit the Omnichannel Contact part.

4
00:00:15,201 --> 00:00:20,357
Auto detect time zone works out the contact's time zone from their phone number.

5
00:00:20,357 --> 00:00:24,373
Require time zone makes it mandatory when auto detect is off.

6
00:00:24,845 --> 00:00:28,694
Use Do not call, Use Do not SMS and Use Do not email

7
00:00:28,694 --> 00:00:31,481
show each preference on the contact.

8
00:00:31,481 --> 00:00:34,135
Only Do not call is on by default.

9
00:00:34,588 --> 00:00:40,808
The part also adds the Contact Methods list, where phone numbers and email addresses are stored.

10
00:00:40,808 --> 00:00:45,868
Dialers, loads and imports always read numbers from it, so leave it in place.

